   <titleInfo>
      <title>Spring Awakening Festival</title>
   </titleInfo>
   <abstract>The Tech Activities Board, in collaboration with Res Life Villages and SEAC (Student Environmental Action Coalition), hosted the Spring Awakening Festival at Tennessee Tech's Sherlock Park. This free event featured live performances by The Dirty Guv'nahs, James Wallace and the Naked Light, and Kory Wheeler and friends.</abstract>
